      "paperId": "edfa0fb10db4d3c4f127dec3f63a36817c84f331",
      "title": "In Search of Lost Community: The Literary Image between \"Proust\" and \"Baudelaire\" in Walter Benjamin's Modernization Lament",
      "authors": [
        {
          "name": "Karyn Ball",
          "authorId": "92319661"
